{"title":"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of 8 one-digit positive integers is 68. If seven of these integers are equal, determine the other integer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number that appears <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times while let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the number. Since the sum of all of the numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/8/9782dd7447f84ce6adcf7945b86038e379c618f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$68$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/2/292c80291154aad209b8f25f70b90d0c002d8e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7x + y = 68$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are positive integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> cannot be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or less because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/8/088b74e3ec371dec5919e847162e5c36998d9d77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$68 - 8 \\times 7 = 68 - 56 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"208\" height=\"15\" />, which is too large for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/a/04a7a2005b67ab81ee5ff231b2f370f1d71ebe1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 9$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/5/6155ff80218b7d7042ad3d2a2e58ca53c09f89a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 \\times 9 + y = 68$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/c/91c6e39ceb5f1bb500f1d6706ba080490fb1bc31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 68 - 7 \\times 9 = 68 - 63 = \\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"244\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC\">2014 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 2\">Individual Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Individual 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 2\">Individual 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 3\">Individual 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_4\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 4\">Individual 4</a> <b>•</b>